    <!-- First-run wizard -->
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Wizard_Title">Welcome to StandbyAndTimer</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Wizard_Body" xml:space="preserve">Quick 30-second tour:&#x0a;&#x0a;1. Press TIMER to set the system clock to 0.5 ms — lower input lag, smoother audio. To have it turn on at every start, click UNLOCKED on the Timer card to lock it.&#x0a;&#x0a;2. AUTO PURGE is OFF by default. Turn it on and set thresholds only if your standby cache regularly bloats during games. Most people don't need it.&#x0a;&#x0a;3. Drag a game .exe into the Game Mode list to give it High priority + full CPU affinity when it launches. Games you play fullscreen are added on their own, tagged AUTO.&#x0a;&#x0a;Everything runs from the tray — closing the window keeps it alive.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Wizard_Finish">Got it</sys:String>

